    "description": "The Payments Capture API enables the processing and capture of payment transactions in batch. This endpoint allows businesses to efficiently finalize payment authorizations, ensuring transactions are completed successfully. Typical consumers include e-commerce platforms and payment service providers that need to automate payment processing. By utilizing this API, users can increase operational efficiency and enhance the overall customer payment experience.",
